Missed BG Readings - SMS to all numbers
========================================
Adds SMS notification to all whitelisted numbers when the missed BG readings
alarm fires. Uses the same KeepAliveWorker trigger as the existing alarm so
it works even when the AAPS loop is suspended due to missing CGM data.

Toggle "Report missed BG readings" added to SMS Communicator preferences (default ON).
SMS text: "Missed BG readings" (same as existing notification).

--- 1. core/keys/src/main/kotlin/app/aaps/core/keys/BooleanKey.kt ---
After: SmsReportPumpUnreachable("smscommunicator_report_pump_unreachable", true),
Add:   SmsReportMissedBgReadings("smscommunicator_report_missed_bg_readings", true),

--- 2. implementation/src/main/kotlin/app/aaps/implementation/alerts/LocalAlertUtilsImpl.kt ---
Inside checkStaleBGAlert(), after the NsClient announcement block, before the closing }:
Add:
            if (preferences.get(BooleanKey.SmsReportMissedBgReadings))
                smsCommunicator.sendNotificationToAllNumbers(rh.gs(R.string.missed_bg_readings))

--- 3. plugins/main/src/main/kotlin/app/aaps/plugins/main/general/smsCommunicator/SmsCommunicatorPlugin.kt ---
After: addPreference(AdaptiveSwitchPreference(ctx = context, booleanKey = BooleanKey.SmsReportPumpUnreachable, ...))
Add:   addPreference(AdaptiveSwitchPreference(ctx = context, booleanKey = BooleanKey.SmsReportMissedBgReadings, summary = R.string.smscommunicator_report_missed_bg_readings_summary, title = R.string.smscommunicator_missed_bg_readings))

--- 4. plugins/main/src/main/res/values/strings.xml ---
After: <string name="smscommunicator_pump_unreachable">Report pump unreachable</string>
Add:
    <string name="smscommunicator_report_missed_bg_readings_summary">Send SMS to all numbers if missed BG readings alarm is triggered</string>
    <string name="smscommunicator_missed_bg_readings">Report missed BG readings</string>
